{"about_the_game":"Learn to improvise during a fight with an opponent in Stigfinnare.  Players on 5 different maps with their tasks and features.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068510/extras/ec1bd6fcab7aabb7a4fa197e1d161e4f.webp?t=1587754052\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br> You will always get a new experience playing this game because everything is random here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068510/extras/mapsHeader1.png?t=1587754052\" /></span><br>Defense a hill with a hairdryer on KOTH map, create your minefield at Trapdoor map, get into enemy bases and steal resources at Electrize map. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068510/extras/acd5321b98a3f1f66d62a1eaf437a80d.webp?t=1587754052\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br>Fight in a team or split to get the points needed to change your character.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068510/extras/4f551e3d51d6643c9200738131453de8.webp?t=1587754052\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br> You can play with your friends in private lobbies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1068510/extras/1a985af1e5c579437f1535e32c48a584.webp?t=1587754052\" width=400 height=50 /></span><br> In this game you will find:<br> Battle for energy at map &quot;Electrize&quot;<br> Detecting of enemy positions at map &quot;Destruction&quot;<br> Making decisions fast to reach the finish line first, or turn and try luck on Maze map<br> Creating strategies with set traps on Trapdoor map<br> Epic battles with a hairdryer and blowing off enemies from platforms on KOTH map<br> Hide&amp;Seek on Camouflage map<br> All this you can do in a network game.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"64ed590c6dc9a77d9506d76ace2587ed583c4910.jpg","localized_name":"Annihilation ","name":"Annihilation ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/64ed590c6dc9a77d9506d76ace2587ed583c4910.jpg"},{"icon":"bc3b98ca9e008bbf88d562682794ae703802e3e3.jpg","localized_name":"Thief","name":"Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/bc3b98ca9e008bbf88d562682794ae703802e3e3.jpg"},{"icon":"404ed83a2c036e073cb4abc4c842f0dab5060679.jpg","localized_name":"The palaces of the mind","name":"The palaces of the mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/404ed83a2c036e073cb4abc4c842f0dab5060679.jpg"},{"icon":"2d79cfa34a7494aaa0e67595c37f31bdef7c95e3.jpg","localized_name":"It's a trap!","name":"It's a trap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/2d79cfa34a7494aaa0e67595c37f31bdef7c95e3.jpg"},{"icon":"ec12c959a80f2e09544d8cb32a3491d861091c4d.jpg","localized_name":"TheKing","name":"TheKing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/ec12c959a80f2e09544d8cb32a3491d861091c4d.jpg"},{"icon":"c6af7bcd514f59ee5ade51a08699fb32ef54b198.jpg","localized_name":"HEADSHOT","name":"HEADSHOT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/c6af7bcd514f59ee5ade51a08699fb32ef54b198.jpg"},{"icon":"eb7cc72574ce42727f205d788b42ec87a748277f.jpg","localized_name":"Now you are clear","name":"Now you are clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/eb7cc72574ce42727f205d788b42ec87a748277f.jpg"},{"icon":"a8a1d3a890f959a28bc3745a833f8da7f4ce28f4.jpg","localized_name":"Six-inch blade","name":"Six-inch blade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1068510/a8a1d3a890